  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Common Bitch**: back after 35 archived shows (366 days) [2]\n- **Cover It With Gas And Set It On Fire**: back after 90 archived shows (783 days) [2]\n- **Seconds**: back after 61 archived shows (600 days) [2]\n- **ICPMFOI**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Ode To Rene**: back after 257 archived shows (3235 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2002-08-22.schoepsMK41.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 30 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Performance featured only Gene, Dean and a drum machine, a lineup not used since 1996 [1]\n- The show, billed as Claude Aid, was a benefit for Claude Coleman, who was injured in a car accident [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2002-08-22.schoepsMK41.flac16**: taped by Unknown; transferred by Unknown; source: Schoeps MK41>VMS>SBM1>DAP1 [1]. Also: Files were converted from the original shn set to FLAC and renamed; otherwise identical. Originally all three bands shared one set [1]",
